🧾 Task 3: Viewing Page Source
📄 What is Page Source?

The raw code returned by the server:

HTML

CSS

JavaScript

🧨 Findings from Page Source
1️⃣ HTML Comments

Developers often leave comments like:

<!-- Temporary homepage -->


These can reveal:

hidden pages

dev notes

internal URLs

✅ Flag:
THM{HTML_COMMENTS_ARE_DANGEROUS}

2️⃣ Hidden Links

Links not visible on the UI but present in HTML.

✅ Flag:
THM{NOT_A_SECRET_ANYMORE}

