🎯 What Is Content Discovery?

In web application security, content means anything hosted by the application, not just visible pages.

Examples:

Hidden directories

Admin or staff portals

Backup files

Logs & config files

Old versions of pages

Cloud storage (S3 buckets)

👉 Content Discovery is the process of finding non-obvious, unintended, or hidden resources.

🧭 Content Discovery Methods

There are three primary approaches:

Method	Description
Manual	Checking files & behaviour by hand
Automated	Using tools + wordlists
OSINT	External public information
